SUMMARY:Lunch Conversation with Kevin Roose & Ethan Mollick: The Future and Business of AI
DESCRIPTION:Join Stanford Law School and Cravath\, Swaine & Moore LLP for a special lunch conversation with Kevin Roose\, Host of Hard Fork and Machine Gods\, and Ethan Mollick\, Associate Professor at the Wharton School of the University of Pennsylvania\, timed to the release of their new books on artificial intelligence: Roose’s The AGI Chronicles: The Inside Story of the Race to Create an Artificial Superintelligence and Mollick’s Co-Existence: The Next Phase of AI. Together\, they’ll explore where AI is headed\, what it means for work and society\, and how leaders should think about what comes next. \nRegister using the buttons below. \n\nhttps://law.stanford.edu/event/kevin-roose-ethan-mollick-the-future-and-business-of-ai/\n\nThis event is open to the Stanford community.
URL:https://law.stanford.edu/event/kevin-roose-ethan-mollick-the-future-and-business-of-ai/
LOCATION:@ SLS: Room 290\, 559 Nathan Abbott Way\, Stanford\, CA\, 94305-8610\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lunchtime Speakers
GEO:37.4135757;-122.1689284
